: \"note\", \"q\": \"CIs were calculated based on BLS-reported RSE where available.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Variances for CPS labor force estimates were calculated using the BLS approximate standard error formulas derived for CPS.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The variances for NEISS-Work data and CPS data were pooled to estimate the variance for injury rates.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}